Package: org.Hs.eg.ice
Title: Human Gene Annotation via the biocOnIce Iceberg Catalog
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Bioconductor", "Core Team",
    email = "maintainer@bioconductor.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Thin dplyr/DuckDB accessors over the biocOnIce public Iceberg
    catalog, scoped to human (NCBI taxon 9606). A demonstration of a
    less-interventional alternative to AnnotationDbi's select()/mapIds()/
    keytypes() query surface: no OrgDb class, no Bimap objects, no keytype
    whitelist -- just lazy tables a caller can filter() and join() directly.
    Depends on no AnnotationDbi infrastructure. See PlanFor3.24.md Milestone 7
    in the BioconductorAnnotationPipeline repository for the design rationale.
License: Artistic-2.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    DBI,
    dbplyr,
    dplyr,
    duckdb
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
